      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Vaiden donated land for the final stretch of the Central Railroad, turning it into a regular stop between Jackson and Memphis.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaiden%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Vaiden served as Carroll County's original county seat before the courthouse moved to Carrollton.",
